# Integrity pin for the arduino-generic source scripts/build-agsim.sh compiles and
# runs. The root module is not in go.mod, so go.sum does not cover it, and
# first-party modules bypass the checksum database; this file is its go.sum.
# Format: <module> <version> <h1 hash of the module zip>. Bumping the
# arduino-generic/sdk/go dependency means adding the new version's line here:
#   go mod download -json github.com/jeremyhahn/arduino-generic@<version>   (the "Sum" field)
github.com/jeremyhahn/arduino-generic v0.7.0-alpha h1:DGXSpl8PvhKiIGXMyH2/ct4bx/JPAWrXHMtSa0qmGic=
